WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.139
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Save Your Best Prompts.

2
00:00:05.439 --> 00:00:10.134
Build your own prompt library to save time. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:15.384
Step one. When a prompt works well, keep it. Do not forget it.

4
00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:23.276
Step two. Make a template. Replace the parts that change with words in brackets, like role, text and audience.

5
00:00:24.283 --> 00:00:31.478
Step three. Save your templates in a note, a document or a spreadsheet. This is your own prompt library.

6
00:00:32.483 --> 00:00:38.366
Step four. Next time, replace the brackets and press Enter. You save time every day.

7
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:43.094
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:43.394 --> 00:00:45.335
Save your 3 best prompts.

9
00:00:45.635 --> 00:00:47.855
Make a template with brackets for each.

10
00:00:48.155 --> 00:00:49.946
Name each template clearly.

11
00:00:50.246 --> 00:00:51.293
Well done!

